            <div xml:id="m-03e5dcde-b205-426e-b4e3-2818ee0071b8">
              <lg xml:id="m-951dbdf1-1279-462a-aa31-dd8d86ee9d1f">
                <l xml:id="m-1beb68d1-74db-4776-bec2-be3122a21ac2" facs="#m-0cf4c1fc-37bd-4fbf-b4f8-58389cdcc4a1" label="ambiguous">200</l><l xml:id="m-da2ed89d-3981-4e33-bb98-646b94e989a1" facs="#m-ba098429-4346-419f-948e-447eb78ba69a" label="text-like">Wednesday at Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-b08ca174-5481-45af-8406-04d00f4d8516" facs="#m-3f983cf2-6490-4dcd-b061-9eb1efa9671e" label="text-like">WEDNESDAY AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-d5e3f7fd-f0d5-47a3-b796-f2737d312b9b" facs="#m-f1f1ef53-d82b-4148-94dc-136a2bdebb0d" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-22c82bae-ad9d-4e73-a059-67099800513c" facs="#m-e2215931-5695-4ce9-be60-81a5064d01f6" label="ambiguous">2.D</l><l xml:id="m-852c7748-4e39-451e-bd50-38ca135ccb62" facs="#m-67480e44-54a4-4617-baf4-78669657e2ff" label="ambiguous">B</l><l xml:id="m-2e351001-5033-4edd-9092-5fd47a952e5f" facs="#m-fc4f7483-880e-4714-a474-74536834cb47" label="lyrics-like">E-a-ti ómnes“ qui tíment Dóminum. Eu oua e</l><l xml:id="m-57be2a0b-131a-43cb-8b70-fd85ec53435d" facs="#m-4c1ffc0e-0f52-42b4-8402-0d4cd52fd407" label="ambiguous">P.T</l><l xml:id="m-db81a501-9c76-4cbc-8e6b-cd3781cc24af" facs="#m-e10cf0c9-fa43-4999-bbc4-3574cf27d0ca" label="ambiguous">Ant 2.94</l><l xml:id="m-d1c32a53-3d2b-4faf-870e-2640cfb716ec" facs="#m-e42cbc23-9fe5-4f04-913f-84fc91b0b2ab" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-6919b832-e48f-420d-bfb5-c688be16185b" facs="#m-ef4eebd7-6e93-4cb1-9e5e-6163224d4592" label="lyrics-like">Lle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-e7bb6046-9f5e-4b9a-b635-1d567ff3532d" facs="#m-1ac6c6d8-8565-4989-a24f-1fa1abab1361" label="ambiguous">Psalm 127.</l><l xml:id="m-5aa61ce9-bf15-4445-9029-b7122083f02e" facs="#m-8fe16069-63b7-4651-a8a4-e494e9ffd51c" label="lyrics-like">DEáti ómnes qui timent Dóminum, * qui ámbulant in vsis éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-f6245e80-90a1-463d-8178-4b160252ad6d" facs="#m-40ad4006-7c66-49e0-8712-940df9e7d93d" label="lyrics-like">D2. Labóres mánuum tuárum quia manducábis:*beátus es, et bene</l><l xml:id="m-3fe09943-696d-47ff-ab02-11c159d0cfa3" facs="#m-03c3a7f6-bdfb-4c90-b945-c54c3295f6fe" label="lyrics-like">tbi érit.</l><l xml:id="m-8bafee68-963a-41ca-9de3-03b5ed31d5ab" facs="#m-ed88de3c-1d53-4693-8066-40bc6a164ae8" label="lyrics-like">3. Uxor túa sicut vítis abúndans, “in latéribus dómus túae.</l><l xml:id="m-5a9782c2-ecbd-45d7-9f58-3da6deec1aee" facs="#m-65d69ba7-0c11-41fd-96ff-3611862b717a" label="lyrics-like">1. Fslii túi sicut novéllae olivárum, * in circúitu ménsae túae.</l><l xml:id="m-b8965915-a816-4902-854d-0a0ab0d7de8a" facs="#m-42735395-3e4d-4f2f-a872-eabf3405d7fa" label="lyrics-like">5. Ecce sic benedicétur hómo * qui tímet Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-931412af-fde3-4707-8cb3-2b2ee88af10f" facs="#m-384c67c9-039d-4898-bfb7-ee25d314c790" label="lyrics-like">6. Benedícat tibi Dóminus ex Sion: * et videas bóna Jerúsalem</l><l xml:id="m-59d9a704-fecb-4639-99e1-9aedf42deca5" facs="#m-41bde1d9-f0ad-4ae4-8af7-a62f9edc3922" label="lyrics-like">ómnibus diébus vitae túae.</l><l xml:id="m-41869978-2c52-43ad-af22-e5d11d6033c1" facs="#m-a0721a99-8ed7-4f1c-aaec-e86e0a2ee1ae" label="lyrics-like">7. Et videas filios filiórum tuórum, *pá̂cem super Israel.</l><l xml:id="m-227def92-0529-49c4-b521-cbbfc692433a" facs="#m-c2ae1ff5-4ba7-4ce5-84d7-b3262c6885a1" label="lyrics-like">8. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-6afd6242-1b52-4d87-971f-757c45dd0189" facs="#m-cc413b50-441e-458a-ac9c-7aa106f6bbb1" label="lyrics-like">9. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sómper, * et in saécula saccu¬</l><l xml:id="m-59671db9-ef8e-4cd1-b948-2f1360674cb9" facs="#m-323fcf37-0384-48f0-af10-f8a2aed7bf22" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-3dd005a3-43da-4b69-aec9-6f12da0d908c" facs="#m-c37ee4f3-574c-4f79-93d2-9400422274e7" label="ambiguous">2.Ant.E</l><l xml:id="m-4b68a7ef-379d-483c-bd4d-ef28498cbc35" facs="#m-5380edf4-1ef5-43d8-a224-5dc369902edb" label="ambiguous">s.6</l><l xml:id="m-4a6b4c16-5238-423f-a8a9-e1c521fc84e9" facs="#m-1e90976e-fa2c-475e-9b3c-937e1f3f9b94" label="lyrics-like">Onfundántur ómnes</l><l xml:id="m-433356c2-3028-4343-b705-05342b216f3c" facs="#m-63cfd756-ae80-4751-bb0c-792b4f1d7307" label="lyrics-like">qui odérunt Sí-on.</l><l xml:id="m-2e6a1fb1-3230-4a15-a113-6573275bfa7e" facs="#m-0dae75b8-c6bc-4c23-8f1c-63528ca3c14a" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-1da88721-fda1-496e-8232-523440fc2e78" facs="#m-92df0c91-2aa9-4c60-8557-32999f042a2e" label="ambiguous">Psalm 128.</l><l xml:id="m-7fff9ce2-cf35-448c-b35e-832fc7bc794b" facs="#m-c9700a4c-0ba1-4f50-9b61-39ba14fbbd5b" label="lyrics-like">NAepe expugnavérunt me a juventúte méa, * dicat nunc Israel:</l><l xml:id="m-c03fb1d8-5217-4170-8996-fb2c83d6c90c" facs="#m-b9a9d105-090c-4415-928f-e7ab65c97331" label="lyrics-like">2. Saepe expugnavérunt me a juventúte méa: “étenim nor</l><l xml:id="m-67e349eb-f00b-4de4-8250-b5c34dfe1e24" facs="#m-8701c64b-affe-4ec6-9285-97395ab41e18" label="lyrics-like">potuérunt mihi.</l><l xml:id="m-d3ab4669-efb5-4213-a05c-d9ec0d3b2bbb" facs="#m-fb6428d1-3930-46c1-b5f3-220b0dac9fe7" label="lyrics-like">3. Supra dórsum méum fabricavérunt peccatóres:“prolongavérun</l><l xml:id="m-76d9855c-3a35-43e9-9cd5-50312b2f2c3e" facs="#m-0e056e19-9ba7-4fec-8755-1e6fe7427dde" label="lyrics-like">iniquitátem súam.</l><l xml:id="m-2fcc7991-300a-4d70-b2d1-420b819e0d0c" facs="#m-5a6baf0a-11bd-4ef6-a670-50fa9ad48c28" label="lyrics-like">4. Dóminus jústus concidit cervices peccatórum:“*confundántur e</l><l xml:id="m-20bf46b2-a168-4ee2-91a7-e2c9e946d112" facs="#m-c09b47cf-162e-469e-8650-3f01b6599e03" label="lyrics-like">convertántur retrórsum ómnes qui odérunt Sion.</l><l xml:id="m-6f894138-e040-42b8-bc26-b7a9249ffc9f" facs="#m-963151eb-1098-4fbe-b26e-2cceeec2bf00" label="lyrics-like">5. Fiant sicut foénum tectórum :* quod priúsquam evellátur, exáruit</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>